msgctxt "share/03_share3"
msgid ""
"\n"
"If you are turned into a frog\n"
"Eva Earlong can help!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Jos olet muuttunut sammakoksi\n"
"Eeva Pitkäkorva voi auttaa!"

